    {
      "text": "Page render with Fig. 4, 'Overview of the different personas that may be involved in the delivery of antenatal care services' (source: WHO 2012): a grid of eight health worker cadres against selected antenatal interventions, marked with green check marks or red crosses. Beside it, text introduces section 2.2, Related personas.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
